  "question": {
    "text": "The number of<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;digit number that can be formed using the digits <math><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>7</mn></math> and <math><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;which are divisible by <math><mn>11</mn></math> and&nbsp;no digit is repeated is:"
