  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Only one possibility is there, <math><mo>(</mo><mn>9,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> or <math><mo>(</mo><mn>0,5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>)</mo></math> as in even or odd places<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Total number of required <math><mn>6</mn></math> digit numbers</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;in odd and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;in even places<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;in even places and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;in odd places<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></math></p>"
